WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.852
Karamɔ de na SaloneHCM administrator guide.

2
00:00:02.852 --> 00:00:09.631
Lɛk administrator, a man i kɔntrol usay kin aksɛs di sistɛm, wetin dɛn alaw fɔ du, ɛn au yu ɔganiseshɔn kɔnfiga.

3
00:00:09.631 --> 00:00:16.954
Insay di nɛks fyu minit wi go kɔva yuza mɛnejment, rol flag dɛn, ɔganiseshɔn sɛtin dɛn, branch ɔfis dɛn, ɛn di audit log.

4
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.349
Mek wi stat wit yuza dɛn ɛn aksɛs.

5
00:00:20.349 --> 00:00:26.524
Frɔm ya a man invit nyu yuza dɛn bay email, risɛt password dɛn, ɛn pul akant dɛn we dɛn nɔ nid igen.

6
00:00:26.524 --> 00:00:31.834
Luk di rol pil dɛn nɛks to ɛch nem — admin, employee, ɛn spɛshial kapabiliti flag dɛn.

7
00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:36.461
Tu flag dɛn impɔtant bad bad fɔ faynanshial kɔntrol.

8
00:00:36.461 --> 00:00:40.968
Di Finance Officer flag mek wan yuza rayviu ɛn apruf payroll voucher dɛn.

9
00:00:40.968 --> 00:00:45.784
Di MoF apruva flag mek dɛn sayn payroll rɔn dɛn ɛn ɔtɔrayz voucher pemɛnt dɛn.

10
00:00:45.784 --> 00:00:54.922
Gi dɛn wit wan klik pan di banknɔt aykɔn — ɛn mɛmba: sɛpareshɔn ɔf dyuti dɛn ɛnfɔs ɔtɔmatik, so nɔ wan pɔsin nɔ go ebul fɔ pul mɔni kɔmɔt im wanwɔd.

11
00:00:56.250 --> 00:01:09.210
Ɔnda sɛtin dɛn a man mɛnej yu ɔganiseshɔn profayl, yu sabskripshɔn taya, intɛgreshɔn dɛn lɛk SMS ɛn email, sikyuriti pɔlisi dɛninklud two-factor authentication, ɛn di pɔblik transparɛnsi pɔtal fɔ gɔvmɛnt tɛnant dɛn.

12
00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:19.301
If yu ɔganiseshɔn submit payroll voucher dɛn frɔm mɔltipul branch dɛn, distrikt dɛn, ɔ ministry dɛn, a man difayn dɛn ɔfis dɛn ya.

13
00:01:19.301 --> 00:01:28.280
Ɛch branch gɛt im yunik kɔd, wan ɔpshɔnal ministry link, ɛn wan branch supervisor we in apruvɛl kin nid bifo dɛn branch in voucher rich hɛdkwɔta.

14
00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:32.058
A man kin asayn wɛl ɛmplɔyi dɛn to dɛn branch frɔm dis skrin.

15
00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:51.599
Fɔ las, di audit log. Ɛvri sɛnsitiv akshɔn insay SaloneHCM — ɛvri apruvɛl, ɛvri chenj, ɛvri pemɛnt ɔtɔrayzeshɔn — dɛn rikɔd am ya wit usay du am ɛn ustem.

16
00:01:51.599 --> 00:01:55.666
If wan rɛgyuleta ɔ di Auditor General aks, di ansa de wan sɔch awe.

17
00:01:56.250 --> 00:02:05.942
Na dat di administrator ɛsɛnshial dɛn: kɔntrol aksɛs tayt tayt, gi faynanshial pawa dɛn dilaybɛt, kip yu sɛtin dɛn kɔrɛnt, ɛn lɛf di audit log fɔ du di mɛmba.

18
00:02:05.942 --> 00:02:11.034
Tek di administrator sɛtifikeshɔn quiz insay di Training Center fɔ kɔnfɛm yu nolej.
